# me_mem_ok -> me_clk_en feedthrough; exact with the supply signalling ready one edge earlier (qfd_sp_res_ser RS 40 -> 41).
# safe-qwen S-A6 (2026-10-08, REVIEW_20261008 A6): the controller's registered FIFO head word (FQ_HEAD=1: decode reads a
# flop, cutting u_ctrl.fq_rd -> fq[] mux -> DYN add -> me_tiles, post-CTS TT -747.5; +1 edge only when the FIFO ran dry)
# and po_me_clk false-pathed as the clock output it is (route + sign-off SDC, mc/qfd_sp_constants_sequencer_fqh).
# The approved me_mem_ok -> me_clk_en station is NOT in this variant (needs the supply's ready one edge early: REVIEW_QUEUE).
# qwen-rtl-finish 2026-10-07 re-cut (split-exact): issue shell inside, me_mem_ok -> me_clk_en unstationed, embedding decode moved to the SU (su_asrc, su_tok out)
TOP=ot_qfd_sp_constants_sequencer
SRCS='rtl/qwen_sys/missing_masters_20261007/gen/ot_qfd_sp_constants_sequencer.sv rtl/qwen_sys/missing_masters_20261007/gen/ot_qwen_rom_core_ctrl.sv rtl/qwen_sys/missing_masters_20261007/ot_qfd_spine_masters.sv rtl/rom/ot_qwen_tp_seq_w12.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_dyn_ttiles.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_qwen_int8_embed_decode.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_cg.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_delay.sv rtl/qwen_sys/missing_masters_20261007/ot_qfd_split_exact.sv'
